"\n\n\n\n\n## Ordered\n\n\n## Review\nThe food is clean and consistent.  \nI liked that the seasoning wasn't overpowering.  \nThe sweet and sour pork didn't have any gamey smell, and the batter was just right.  \n\nHowever, the Jjamppong was the real standout here—generous portions and perfectly balanced.  \n\nThe spacious parking lot is also a big plus.\n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n"